@startuml Code_Splitting_Performance
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam sequence {
  LifelineBorderColor #333
  ParticipantBorderColor #333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #e8f4f8
  ArrowColor #333
  GroupBorderColor #666
  GroupBackgroundColor #ffffcc
}

participant "Browser\n(Network)" as browser
participant "Vite\n(Build tool)" as vite
participant "JavaScript\nEngine" as engine
participant "App.jsx\n(Router)" as app
participant "HeroBanner\n(Static)" as hero
participant "Lazy components\n(About, Services, etc)" as lazy

autonumber

== Build Time ==
group Build Phase
  browser -> vite: npm run build
  vite -> vite: Analyze dependencies
  vite -> vite: Apply manualChunks:\n- vendor.js (React, Vite, etc)\n- ui.js (Icons)\n- main.js (App code)\n- BlogIndex.js (lazy)
  vite -> vite: Tree-shake unused code
  vite -> vite: Minify with esbuild
  vite -> vite: Apply Brotli compression\n(.br files)
  vite --> browser: dist/ ready\n(vendor, ui, main, features)
end

== Runtime: Initial Page Load ==
group Page Load Phase
  browser -> browser: Request https://portfolio.com/
  browser -> vite: GET index.html\n+ CSS + critical JS

  browser -> browser: Parse HTML\n(~200ms on 4G)

  group Critical Path (Blocking)
    browser -> browser: Load vendor.js\n(React, Router, Framer)\n(~150ms on 4G, 45kb Brotli)
    browser -> browser: Load main.js\n(App, routing)\n(~100ms on 4G, 20kb Brotli)
  end

  group Non-blocking Path (Parallel)
    browser -> browser: Load style.css\n(Tailwind critical)\n(~50ms)
    browser -> browser: Load ui.js\n(React Icons)\n(~50ms)
  end

  browser -> engine: Execute vendor.js
  engine -> engine: Evaluate React\nInitialize Router

  browser -> engine: Execute main.js
  engine -> engine: Evaluate App.jsx\nInitialize routing

  engine -> app: React.mount() at #root
  activate app

  app -> hero: Render HeroBanner\n(STATIC IMPORT - immediate)
  activate hero

  hero -> hero: Render Hero section
  hero -> hero: Render About section
  hero -> hero: Render Skills section

  note right of browser
    **LCP Achieved ~1.1s**
    (Hero visible + interactive)
    (estimación inicial ~1.8s, confirmado\npor auditoría real en 1.1s — Lighthouse\nDesktop, 2026-06-18)
  end note

  hero --> app: Hero rendered
  deactivate hero

  app -> lazy: Start loading lazy components\n(non-blocking)
  note over lazy
    About, Services, Works, Contact
    loaded in background
    Suspense shows Skeleton while loading
  end note

  note right of browser
    **FID: <50ms**
    (Hero interactive, lazy loading in background)
  end note

  deactivate app
end

== Navigation: Home → /blog ==
group Route Transition
  browser -> app: User clicks "Blog" link
  app -> app: React Router intercepts\n(no full page reload)

  app -> lazy: Render BlogIndex\n(React.lazy — loads chunk on demand)
  activate lazy
  lazy -> lazy: Load BlogIndex.js chunk\n(Suspense shows Skeleton)
  lazy -> lazy: Fetch blogData.js\n(locale-aware import)
  lazy -> lazy: Render blog index cards
  lazy --> app: BlogIndex ready
  deactivate lazy
end

== Performance Metrics ==
group Final Metrics
  note right of browser
    Lighthouse 2026-06-18 (Desktop, incógnito) — ver CLAUDE.md:
    ✓ LCP: 1.1s (target: <2.5s)
    ✓ TBT: 0ms
    ✓ CLS: 0 (target: 0)
    ✓ FCP: 0.6s · SI: 1.0s
    ✓ Lighthouse Performance: 98/100 (Mobile Slow 4G: 61/100)
    ⚠ Bundle size (Brotli): no auditado / no documentado
  end note
end

@enduml
